{"id":"624066","name":"青瓜黑木耳拌大虾","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/624066/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青瓜","amount":"一条"},{"name":"黑木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大虾","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备:冰鲜大虾。","img":"images/624066/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"青瓜，泡发好的黑木耳，蒜头。","img":"images/624066/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"黑木耳放入电煮锅里大火煮三分钟。","img":"images/624066/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出来沥水备用。","img":"images/624066/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大虾也放入电煮锅里加少许盐煮至完全变色。","img":"images/624066/step_5.jpeg"},{"step":6,"desc":"焖一会儿，捞出来剥壳。","img":"images/624066/step_6.jpeg"},{"step":7,"desc":"青瓜拍拍，用手折成小块。","img":"images/624066/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"剁点蒜末。","img":"images/624066/step_8.jpeg"},{"step":9,"desc":"调个酱汁:油醋汁，老干妈，蒜末拌均匀即可。","img":"images/624066/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"所有食材备好了装盘里。","img":"images/624066/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"淋上酱汁，开吃咯。","img":"images/624066/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/624066/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/624066/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}